Cell["\<\
The figure shows the values of the quality function QF(n) for integers 0 \
\[LessEqual] n \[LessEqual] 25.The zeros of the graph identify all \
narcissistic numbers in the considered range. Since every single digit number \
is equal to the sum of its digits raised to the first power, the numbers 0-9 \
appear as zeros of the function. Values close to zero indicate numbers that \
nearly satisfy the narcissistic condition.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990682685773314*^9, 3.9906827238865957`*^9}, {
   3.990682901628701*^9, 3.990682901997882*^9}, 
